The Renato Lins logo

The logo artwork that the LogoMark component draws (the SVG path data in
src/components/LogoMark/LogoMark.tsx) and the same artwork in
demo/public/favicon.svg are the personal mark of Renato Lins. They are not
covered by the MIT License above and may not be used as a logo, or to identify
any person, product or service other than Renato Lins.

The rest of LogoMark (its animation, canvas and props) is covered by the MIT
License: a copy may replace the path data with other artwork and use it under
that license.
